<title>JORDAN: INDICATORS - Jordan - Updated July 8.</title>
<headline>INDICATORS - Jordan - Updated July 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>-------------------- KEY INTEREST RATES -----------------------</p>
<p>					 CURRENT     EFFECTIVE   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Central Bank discount rate     8.25 pct     7/7/97     8.50 pct</p>
<p>Central Bank 3-month CD rate   8.52 pct     2/7/97     8.83 pct</p>
<p>Central Bank 6-month CD rate   8.75 pct     2/7/97     9.03 pct</p>
<p>CD repurchasing rate (repo)    9.75 pct     7/7/97     9.50 pct</p>
<p>Overnight interbank rate	 1.98 pct     8/7/97     2.11 pct</p>
<p>Five-year treasury bond	  8.55 pct     8/7/97</p>
<p>---------------- MONTHLY ECONOMIC INDICATORS ------------------</p>
<p>(All figures in million of dinars unless otherwise stated)</p>
